"@Hutong Files: Locals do tai chi then — keep your voice down." = "@Hutong Files：那时本地人在打太极——说话轻点。";
"Saturday night market at the Drum Tower: stall list updated" = "鼓楼周六夜市：摊位名单更新";
"Handmade goods, vinyl and mulled wine; busiest after 19:00. Metro Line 8, Shichahai exit A." = "手作、黑胶和热红酒；19:00 后最热闹。地铁 8 号线什刹海站 A 口。";
"@Ken: Signed up — see you there." = "@Ken：报名了——到时候见。";
"Daoxiangcun loose pastries vs gift boxes: how locals buy" = "稻香村散装点心还是礼盒：本地人怎么买";
"Loose pastries are sold by weight — fresher, and you can mix flavors. Boxes are for giving; no need for yourself." = "散装点心按斤称——更新鲜，还能混口味。礼盒是送人的；自己吃不必。";
"@Xiaoman: Get the date paste and ox-tongue pastry." = "@Xiaoman：买枣泥和牛舌饼。";
"Shichahai after dark: 5 stops, 3 small bars" = "天黑后的什刹海：5 站，3 家小酒馆";
"Start at Yinding Bridge and follow the north shore to the Drum Tower. Quieter after nine; bring a jacket, it's windy." = "从银锭桥出发，沿北岸走到鼓楼。九点后人少；风大，带件外套。";
"@Lina: The brewpub by Yinding Bridge is solid." = "@Lina：银锭桥边那家精酿不错。";
"Corner-tower magnets are back — buy on your way in" = "角楼冰箱贴回来了——进门时买";
"The Shenwu Gate shop restocks in the morning and the corner-tower series sells out. Two per person — don't wait for closing." = "神武门商店上午补货，角楼系列会卖光。每人限购两个——别等到闭园。";
"@Zhou: They had the sunset color yesterday. Go." = "@Zhou：昨天还有日落色。快去。";
"40 minutes in line at Man Heng Ji — worth it?" = "满恒记排 40 分钟——值吗？";
"Hand-cut lamb with sesame dip; once the copper pot boils you know the wait paid off. Take a number before 17:00 and halve it." = "手切羊肉配麻酱；铜锅一开就知道没白等。17:00 前拿号，等待时间减半。";
"@Zhao: Worth it. Order extra sweet garlic." = "@Zhao：值。多加一份糖蒜。";
"Boating at Beihai: the White Dagoba from the water" = "北海划船：从水上看白塔";
"After 4pm the sun softens; a pedal boat for an hour is just right. They stop rentals when it's windy." = "四点后光线柔和；脚踏船一小时正好。起风就停止租船。";
"@Bei: With kids, take the electric boat." = "@Bei：带孩子就选电动船。";

